<title>USA: Fleetwood Enterprises Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Fleetwood Enterprises Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERSIDE, Calif. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.58		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			 21,169		   15,498</p>
<p> Revs		     746,440		  772,030</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  36,357		   46,475</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended April 27 vs April 28.  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.19		    $1.71</p>
<p> Net			124,830		   79,609</p>
<p> Revs		   2,874,426		2,809,277</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  39,162		   46,469</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes gain of $0.06 a share, or $2.8 million, from discontinued operations of finance subsidiary.</p>
<p>1997 year includes gain of $0.89 a share, or $34.8 million, from discontinued operations, including $33.9 million gain from sale of finance subsidiary.</p>
<p>1996 year includes gain of $0.21 a share, or $9.7 million, from discontinued operations, and charge of $0.30 a share from a loss on the disposition of the European RV operation that was sold in May 1996.</p>
</text>
